Runtime half of patches/dream-recomp-pc/0001-idle-skip-for-declared-wait-loops.patch:
idle_poll -> Hooks::on_idle -> System::on_idle, System::idle_loops, device_accesses.
The translator half and boot_main.cpp stay in the PC patch.

